CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'mpd->wbc->sync_mode == WB_SYNC_NONE'
#253: FILE: fs/ext4/inode.c:2462:
+				if (!PageDirty(page) ||
+				    (PageWriteback(page) &&
+				     (mpd->wbc->sync_mode == WB_SYNC_NONE)) ||
+				    unlikely(page->mapping != mapping)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

